                    <th class="content no-padding-bottom small-12 large-12 columns first last" style="Margin:0 auto;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:24.5px;margin:0 auto;padding:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:30px;padding-right:30px;text-align:left;width:640px"><table style="border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><th style="Margin:0;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left">
                        <!-- START Content -->
                        <h2 style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:5px;color:#0071c5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:23.4px;margin:0;margin-bottom:5px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none"><span class="eloquaemail">FirstName</span>,</h2>
                       
                        <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:15px;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;margin-bottom:15px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Congratulations on becoming an Intel<sup>&reg;</sup> Technology Provider Enthusiast PC Specialist!<p>
                                <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:15px;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;margin-bottom:15px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">With over one billion PC gamers in the world<sup>1</sup> and a rapidly growing market, you're well positioned to grow your customer base and drive more revenue with Intel. </p>
                                <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:15px;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;margin-bottom:15px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Take advantage of all the benefits available to you now, including:</p>
                        
                        <ul>
                          <li>Additional points promotions on products with Intel<sup>&reg;</sup> Core™ X-, K-, and H-series processors</li>
                          <li>Enthusiast PC Specialty designation and visibility on the Intel Technology Provider web page</li>
                          <li>Technical webinars by Intel experts</li>
                          <li>World class gaming and software packs</li>
                          <li>Passes to local e-sports events</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:15px;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;margin-bottom:15px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Thank you for partnering with Intel.</p>
                        <!-- START Button CTA -->
